{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1064299-db-charm-modules-for-quickly-creating-db-npcs","id":1064299,"title":"DB Charm Modules - For quickly creating DB NPCs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-18T07:54:10-07:00","id":1064299,"title":"DB Charm Modules - For quickly creating DB NPCs","content":"Now that Crumplepunch`s DB homebrew is close to being done and has charms for every ability ill be starting my work on creating charm packages from the different abilities. Making it really easy for a ST to decide what a DB NPC should be good at and then just be able to pick a few charm packages to create a more or less fully fleshed out DB NPC in a few minutes.<br /> <br /> Can promise that the progress will be glacial and most likely will I just focus on battle abilities and a few other to start with.<br /> <br /> Still need to create summaries for the different load outs about what they roughly can do and important opportunities/strategies they create/enable. Will probably summarize/simplify a lot of the charms, as in cutting text and changing the effects slightly. Generally towards making them easier for a ST to use.<br /> <br /> <br /> Abilities (Status)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mOd-f0n71JhxnwQHmFdJnA-WHa3NUC46FTPItqsd7i8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">War</a> (1st Draft)<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MN6c362n1onouAcfeBdLDY0js9u7WfyLlLoINUCfueM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Awareness</a> (1st Draft)<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AsNlSv7uX_vp1k-vGOs3rmgksqLS-JSiyH9AJOTR7-A/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Melee</a> (WIP)<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sCsj--kan0GhOLmvmFIO7wDCRg25J-u3TTMTfLJBM7U/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Socialize</a> (WIP)<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Fy3pJ3Bk17FP4I7lvhS9fAUROI6EswaXE7qDMYx4zSE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Integrity</a> (WIP)<br /> <br /> <br /> Any and all feedback is great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4567,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","user":"Volivat","date":". 03-25-2017, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-18T23:21:06-07:00","id":1064657,"title":"","content":"So I'm statting up a <i>lot</i> of DB NPCs for the Wyld Hunt, since they're about to come down on my PCs in <i>force; </i>would you be open to suggested packages from other folks? I probably won't create quite as <i>many</i> per ability as you did for War -- more like what Sandact did for his <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/exalted/comments/5mpvpw/3e_exalted_storytelling_guide_beta/\" target=\"_blank\">WIP Storytelling Guide</a> -- but it seems like it might be a start.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, thanks for doing this! And thanks for starting with War -- the Ability I most needed something like this for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7058-kerredai","name":"Kerredai","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-19T02:43:02-07:00","id":1064689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kerredai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1064299-db-charm-modules-for-quickly-creating-db-npcs?p=1064657#post1064657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm statting up a <i>lot</i> of DB NPCs for the Wyld Hunt, since they're about to come down on my PCs in <i>force; </i>would you be open to suggested packages from other folks? I probably won't create quite as <i>many</i> per ability as you did for War -- more like what Sandact did for his <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/exalted/comments/5mpvpw/3e_exalted_storytelling_guide_beta/\" target=\"_blank\">WIP Storytelling Guide</a> -- but it seems like it might be a start.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, thanks for doing this! And thanks for starting with War -- the Ability I most needed something like this for.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sure! and thanks! Just post a link here to a google doc or something similar and I will merge it into the first post and make sure to highlight your contribution. <br /> <br /> If you dont mind, id love to hear back on how these war packages work out in the field.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4567-volivat","name":"Volivat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-19T02:57:36-07:00","id":1064691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Volivat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1064299-db-charm-modules-for-quickly-creating-db-npcs?p=1064689#post1064689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you dont mind, id love to hear back on how these war packages work out in the field.</div> </div> </div> </div>Absolutely! May be a while, though -- the PCs got some forewarning about the incoming Hunt and are plotting to delay them, so it could be a good few weeks before they end up throwing down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7058-kerredai","name":"Kerredai","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-25T14:18:09-07:00","id":1068092,"title":"","content":"The fun part here is that Volivat has been creating DB strategies and awesome combinations, that will be used against him by me. :P I'm pretty sure that as part of creating these and understanding what the un-official DBs can actually do, next session might not be starting with him storming the local DB power center. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1474-rouharu","name":"Rouharu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}